        (42617675) in ICD10/relationships.tdl yields SNOMED CT 436785 (83561009, Spinal stenosis in
        cervical region). SNOMED CT does not distinguish central-vs-lateral at the cervical-region level,
        so the central qualifier is not separately coded; the target denotes cervical spinal stenosis
