        M488A: no region-specific lateral-stenosis SNOMED CT concept exists. Best regional standard target
        is SNOMED CT 321661 (41341006, Spinal stenosis of thoracic region). Broader map with specificity
        loss on the lateral qualifier. Moderate tier.
        """
}
